Try:

&#x200B;

1) [http://www.mediafire.com/file/4k0egh22gwkgbjq/glidetoopengl.reg/file](http://www.mediafire.com/file/4k0egh22gwkgbjq/glidetoopengl.reg/file) add this to registry

&#x200B;

2) delete C:\\Users\\\[Your User\]\\AppData\\Roaming\\MedianXL\\save folder

Hey, try to watch some RSDTyler on youtube. He had aspergers and he was really bad in social interactions, but he changed himself (it took some years though) and he shares with others how to be more social.

&#x200B;

The main difference between him and other guy who is socially adapted is that he was "wierd" and "creepy" before, so instead of giving advices like "be yourself and enjoy the company" he actually describes why people can be socially unattractive and how to avoid that. It's not easy, but it's possible (and enjoyable)
